  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_0
    value: <style=title><size=32>MULTI SLOT GAME</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_0
    value: "<size=18>- Nudge Strike is a Multi Slot Game, consisting of 8 3x3 Reel
      Set Games.\n- Each Slot Game is independent from each other.\n   - Each spin,
      the total sum of the wins from 8 Slot Games is awarded.\n- Player bets all
      8 Slot Games, every spin.\n- At the very bottom, there is a button for Turbo
      Mode.\n- Turbo Mode is a mode that stops all 3 reels at once per Slot.\n   
      Also, Turbo Mode can be turned on/off at a player's discretion during \n   
      any spin like auto spin or regular spin.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_1
    value: <style=title><size=32>WILD NUDGE</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: "<size=18>- Wild Symbol appears with an arrow with random direction, either
      upward\n    or downward.\n- Depending on the direction of an arrow on such
      Wild Symbol, Wild Nudge\n    occurs.\n    - If an arrow points upward, then
      Wild Symbol nudges upward.\n    - If an arrow points downward, then Wild Symbol
      nudges downward.\n- Wild Nudge can occur twice at most.\n    - Wild Nudge continues
      until Wild Symbol touches down the top or\n        bottom spot, then Nudge
      ends.\n- On any Slot Game, 3 Wild Symbols on Win Line #1  awards Jackpot.\n-
      At a spin, up to 8 Jackpots can be awarded. \n</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: <style=coinColor><size=25><b>{0:CommaNumber}</b></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff>9 LINES</color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>BET PER LINE : 1</color></size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES
    value: <style=title><size=28>LINES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_Any
    value: <size=28><b>ANY</size></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_3
    value: <style=title><size=32>MUTIPLIER</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_3
    value: "<size=18>- Except Wild Symbol, Multiplier appears as a Sub-Symbol with
      any other\n    symbols.\r\n- Multiplier Sub-Symbol comes in 3 types, X2, X3
      or X5 and it can take one\n    of the three multipliers.\r\n- Multiplier Sub-Symbol
      is applied to the 3 of a Kind Wins.\r\n- Multiple Multiplier Sub-Symbols are
      added to each other and applied to\n    the 3 of a kind wins.\r\n    - For
      example, X2 and X3 are part of a win, then X5 is applied to the win.\r\n</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_4
    value: <style=title><size=32>GRAND JACKPOT</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_4
    value: "<size=18>-There is one jackpot, Grand Jackpot in Nudge Strike.\n- Grand
      Jackpot includes progressives as well as base amount.\n- If more than one Slot
      Game wins Grand Jackpot, then award\n    progressives on top of base amount
      for the 1st Slot Game and for the\n    rest games, award base amount only.\n</size>"
